<title>HONG KONG: HK Telecom names Wilson exec director.</title>
<headline>HK Telecom names Wilson exec director.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong Telecommunications Ltd said in a statement on Friday Roy Wilson will join the the company as executive director, customer service on March 6. -- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
